//%% [instellingen] waarden=uit code=verborgen stijl=top2026/stijl.css?v=3
//%% [banner] TOP Software · 26 November 2026 | A Complete FP Toolchain in 4 Months | Jan Martin Jansen · {dia} / {n}
//%% [markdown]
// <div class="title-logo"><img src="top2026/sapl-jmvm-banner-light.svg" alt="Sapl &amp; JMVM"></div>
//
// # Building a Complete FP Toolchain in 4 Months
//
// <p class="subtitle">An Experiment in LLM-Driven Software Development</p>
//
// <p class="byline">Jan Martin Jansen · TOP Software · 26 November 2026</p>
